t in  the beginning the three founding members  of the order fought the spawns of Satan  for God it was during this conflict they  discovered three places where God's  power was concentrated they used these  locations to transform into spirits  possessing a power that was second only  to that of God and rose to the heavens  in their ascension they left behind the  dark sides of themselves which became  the lords of shadow Gabriel fort Cornell  and defeated him then gained one of the  three pieces of the god mask a relic he  intended to rebuild to bring back his  late wife he continued on to the land of  vampires and ventured into the castle of  the Lord of vampires herself Carmilla  there he met Camilla's apprentice Laura  before proceeding to crush Carmilla in  battle earning the second piece of the  god mask his triumph was short-lived as  pan appeared and suddenly challenged  Gabriel in a duel to the death  although confused Gabriel fought to  defend himself mortally wounding pan on  his deathbed pan revealed that his true  intention was to sacrifice himself as  blood was needed to be spilled for a  pathway to open for Gabriel to continue  his quest true to his word Gabriel  traveled to the land of necromancer's  and killed the necromancer to obtain the  final piece of the god mask but in a  sudden turn of events though Becca came  forward and revealed that he was the  true lord of the dead in the land of  necromancer's and that it was he who  cast a spell to separate earth from the  heavens his goal to combine the power of  the lords of shadow so that he could  attain it all for himself so strong was  obex desire for power that he searched  through hell for it until another  presence entered his mind and showed him  for dark arts he used the devil mask  relic to control Gabriel to kill his  wife Marie and then Claudia starting the  chain of events his plan would have been  successful if Satan had not suddenly  materialized revealing himself as the  presence who 